WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.006 --> 00:00:10.844
There are a few moments in
the life of an institution

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:12.345
that are historic.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:15.807
This is one of those
very rare moments.

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.643 line:0%
The Living Village is an
expression of a phenomenon

00:00:18.643 --> 00:00:21.771 line:0%
that has been studied by
generations of psychologists

00:00:21.771 --> 00:00:23.523
and other social scientists,

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:27.736
as well as by scholars
of divinity and religion.

00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:29.654
And that is, hope.

00:00:29.654 --> 00:00:32.615
It is historic for Yale
Divinity School,

00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:35.076
not only because it will alter

00:00:35.076 --> 00:00:37.245
the physical structure
of the school,

00:00:37.245 --> 00:00:40.206 line:0%
but it will set an agenda
for the educational program

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.458 line:0%
of the school

00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:45.712 line:0%
that will train students
as apostles of the environment.

00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:49.215
I've waited a long time
to say this line.

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:53.136
I want to reverse the lyrics
of Joni Mitchell's song.

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:58.266
They tore down paradise
to put up a parking lot.

00:00:58.349 --> 00:01:01.644
It is time to tear up a
parking lot

00:01:01.644 --> 00:01:04.272
to put up paradise.

